The '''Lamborghini Revuelto''' ({{IPA|es|reˈβwelto}}) is a [[Mid-engine design|mid-engine]] [[plug-in hybrid]] [[sports car]] produced by the Italian automobile manufacturer [[Lamborghini]]. It was officially unveiled on 29 March 2023 as a successor to the [[Lamborghini Aventador|Aventador]].<ref name="auto3">{{Cite web|url=https://www.carscoops.com/2023/03/1001-hp-lamborghini-lb744-revuelto-phev-can-hit-62-mph-in-2-5-seconds/|title=Lamborghini Unleashes New Revuelto LB744 To Hunt Down Ferraris With 1,001 Hybrid Horses|first=Chris|last=Chilton|date=March 29, 2023|website=Carscoops}}</ref> The Revuelto's namesake is a Spanish [[Spanish-style bullfighting|fighting bull]] that fought in the arena of [[Barcelona]] in the 1880s.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.drive.com.au/caradvice/lamborghini-revuelto-named-after-pronunciation/ | title=The bonkers bull behind the name of Lamborghini's new supercar }}</ref>

The Revuelto entered full production by July 2023,<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-07-26 |title=Lamborghini Revuelto – launch success covers orders spanning two years |url=https://www.lamborghini.com/en-en/news/lamborghini-revuelto-launch-success-covers-orders-spanning-two-years |access-date=2023-08-04 |website=Lamborghini.com |language=en}}</ref> with the first units being delivered in the last quarter of 2023.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.autobild.de/artikel/lamborghini-revuelto-2023-preis-motor-v12-plug-in-hybrid-aventador-lb744-21776741.html|title=Lamborghini Revuelto (2023): Alle Infos – vom Preis bis zum Motor|date=March 29, 2023|website=autobild.de|language=de}}</ref>

==History==
[[File:Logo Lamborghini Revuelto.svg|thumb|left|Logo]]
Lamborghini teased the car on March 22, 2023 on a [[Twitter]] post,<ref>https://www.motorauthority.com/news/1139128_lamborghini-aventador-successor-debuting-march-29</ref> and was unveiled in an online event on 29 March 2023.<ref name="auto3"/> The car is the first of the brand to adopt a [[plug-in hybrid]] propulsion system. While models like the [[Lamborghini Sián FKP 37|Sián FKP 37]] and [[Lamborghini Countach LPI 800-4|Countach LPI 800-4]] had utilised a mild form of a hybrid propulsion system, mainly to improve low-speed drivability, the Revuelto is the first Lamborghini to make use of a true form of a hybrid drivetrain.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.corriere.it/motori/news/anteprime/23_marzo_29/lamborghini-revuelto-prima-ibrida-plug-in-marchio-ha-oltre-1000-cavalli-foto-039d9454-cd64-11ed-ab8e-1e4a885c119f.shtml|title=Lamborghini Revuelto, la prima ibrida plug-in del marchio ha oltre 1.000 cavalli. Le foto.|trans-title=Lamborghini Revuelto, the brand's first plug-in hybrid has over 1,000 horsepower. The Photo|first=Stefano|last=Bargiggia|date=March 29, 2023|website=Corriere|language=it}}</ref>
{{clear left}}

==Design==
===Exterior=== 
